   "source": [
    "# 01 – Data audit, evaluation design and baseline\n",
    "\n",
    "**CT4101 Machine Learning Portfolio Project – Milestone 2 (Data and Baseline Checkpoint)**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Question:** Based on a set of features describing a website’s URL, domain, and page behavior. Can you detect the reliability of the site and determine if it is phishing or a legitimate site?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** UCI *Phishing Websites* (id 327), CC BY 4.0.\n",
    "Mohammad, R. & McCluskey, L. (2012). *Phishing Websites* [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.\n",
    "https://doi.org/10.24432/C51W2X\n",
    "\n",
    "Contents:\n",
    "1. Setup\n",
    "2. Load the data\n",
    "3. Data audit (shape, types, values/outliers, missing values, duplicates, target distribution)\n",
    "4. Cleaning decisions\n",
    "5. Evaluation design (train/test split and cross-validation)\n",
    "6. Preprocessing pipeline\n",
    "7. Baseline results\n",
    "8. Summary and next steps"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2f2cd2fa",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
