   "source": [
    "## 5. Evaluation design\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Hold-out test set (20%)**, stratified by the target and split with a fixed seed. It is put aside now and\n",
    "   **only used once, at the end of the project**, to report final performance of the chosen models. It is never used\n",
    "   for tuning or model selection.\n",
    "2. **5-fold stratified cross-validation on the training set (80%)** is used for everything else: comparing the\n",
    "   baseline and learned models, and tuning hyperparameters in Milestone 3.\n",
    "3. All preprocessing lives **inside a scikit-learn `Pipeline`**, so in each CV fold it is fitted on the training\n",
    "   folds only. This avoids leaking information from validation or test data into preprocessing."
   ]
  },
